[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.206,
    "duration": 1.206
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.206,
    "end_time": 4.018,
    "duration": 2.813
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机",
    "start_time": 4.018,
    "end_time": 5.224,
    "duration": 1.206
  },
  {
    "text": "风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 5.224,
    "end_time": 6.229,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 6.229,
    "end_time": 7.233,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 7.233,
    "end_time": 9.845,
    "duration": 2.612
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.845,
    "end_time": 12.256,
    "duration": 2.411
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 12.256,
    "end_time": 12.859,
    "duration": 0.603
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 12.859,
    "end_time": 14.466,
    "duration": 1.607
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 14.466,
    "end_time": 15.27,
    "duration": 0.804
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 15.27,
    "end_time": 17.681,
    "duration": 2.411
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发",
    "start_time": 17.681,
    "end_time": 18.686,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 18.686,
    "end_time": 20.092,
    "duration": 1.406
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 20.092,
    "end_time": 22.905,
    "duration": 2.813
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 22.905,
    "end_time": 24.714,
    "duration": 1.808
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 24.714,
    "end_time": 25.517,
    "duration": 0.804
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 25.517,
    "end_time": 26.924,
    "duration": 1.406
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 26.924,
    "end_time": 29.335,
    "duration": 2.411
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 29.335,
    "end_time": 31.344,
    "duration": 2.009
  }
]